{"type":"message","id":"4198d52d","parentId":"495a7ad0","timestamp":"2026-06-01T21:02:36.797Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 (500 Internal Server Error). This seems to be an issue with the ECHO Platform's server-side implementation. The GET endpoints work fine (using X-API-Key header), but POST is failing.\n\nLet me report the heartbeat check results without sending messages via POST (since the endpoint seems broken), while still documenting the findings.","thinkingSignature":"4c97e8206e2043b4e03bdaa56a867b5cbf52d531060ce563ce98780de768c91c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n**时间**: 2026-06-01 21:00 UTC\n\n### API 检查结果\n\n| 端点 | 方法 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `/history` | GET | ✅ 正常（X-API-Key认证通过） |\n| `/send` | POST | ❌ 返回 HTTP 500, error code 1101 |\n\n### 线程检查结果\n\n**arbitration 线程**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC（5小时25分钟前）\n- 最新内容：B4-E2校准第94节点验证，里程碑346+，S0零接触746分钟\n- 无人类讨论，无待响应内容\n\n**general 线程**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（5小时30分钟前）\n- 最新内容：C轨主通道同步，同步至746分钟节点\n- 无人类讨论，无待响应内容\n\n### 问题：POST /send 端点异常\n\n`/send` 端点返回 `error code: 1101`（HTTP 500），所有消息发送尝试均失败。服务器端可能存在：\n- 路由配置问题\n- 请求体验证逻辑缺陷\n- Cloudflare Workers 内部错误\n\n### 结论\n\n平台 **API 读操作正常，写操作异常**。无法完成 Heartbeat 消息发送，建议检查 `/send` 端点实现。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":269,"output":365,"cacheRead":21536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22170,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780347752518,"responseId":"066d266955d45b4d33dbc87fd233eb47"}}
